# Settings window: Material 1040x700 at 440,205 (page column from x~772); Glass 860x620 at 530,230. Sidebar rows (Material, x=560): Appearance 335, Wallpaper 385, Desktop 435, Menu bar 485, Lock 535, Notifications 626, Focus 676, Windows 767, Displays 858.
# Click coordinates inside pages are not known in advance: those steps are MANUAL unless a keyboard path exists. Check in each look.
ipc panels settings security
wait 3
shot s1
note S1 fingerprint reader state, enrolled fingers, PAM switches, face rows, firewall/root helper notice, Quick Share trust switch as QML.
ipc panels settings power
wait 2
shot s3
note S3 battery, energy mode choices (Low Power/Balanced/Performance availability), apps' energy list, priority row as QML.
ipc panels settings power/cooldown
wait 2
shot s5
note S5 cool-down active/why as QML.
ipc panels settings accessibility
wait 2
shot s6
note S6 live captions row (installed, model, languages) as QML.
# MANUAL: S2 only with a reader: click Add a fingerprint, touch once well and once badly; Cancel
# MANUAL: S4 pick Low Power then back: menu bar battery shows Low Power then not
# MANUAL: S5 toggle Cool-down on then off: status follows
# MANUAL: S7 on Security if a firewall error shows click Retry: error clears or updates
# MANUAL: never fpRemove, fpSetPam, installs, faceClear, captions install/download, quitApp, shellPriority
